# ftdLesion holds CODE ONLY. Clinical transcripts, sweep outputs, ratings,
# calibration tensors and model weights live outside git:
#   laptop : C:\Users\martx\Analyses\0_securedata\   (patient data)
#   Bouchet: $FTD_BASE, $FTD_STORE                  (see env.sh)
# The rules below are a backstop, not the protection -- keep data out of the
# repo directory in the first place.

# --- data, anywhere in the tree ---------------------------------------------
*.csv
*.tsv
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.jsonl
*.parquet
*.rds
*.RData
*.pt
*.safetensors
*.bin

# CSVs that are code: the prompt registry and the rater item wording
!prompts/registry.csv
!clinician/crude/items.csv

# --- generated directories --------------------------------------------------
client/outputs/*
!client/outputs/.gitkeep
client/archive/
analysis/ratings/*
!analysis/ratings/.gitkeep
logs/
calibration/

# --- tooling ----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.Rproj.user/
.Rhistory
.ipynb_checkpoints/
